---
title: Read path and machine cache
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Read
    Read --> CacheCheck: global inventory
    CacheCheck --> Result: cache hit
    CacheCheck --> ScopedScan: cache miss
    ScopedScan --> StateCache: writes allowed
    ScopedScan --> Result: explicit no-write
    StateCache --> Result: atomic cache write
    Read --> IndexCheck: query
    IndexCheck --> Result: index current
    IndexCheck --> MemoryRebuild: missing or stale
    MemoryRebuild --> Result: snapshot
    Result --> [*]
    note right of MemoryRebuild
      Canonical roots stay unchanged
    end note
